	<section_number>46.2-365</section_number>
	<catch_line>Plaintiff not prevented from relying upon other legal process</catch_line>
	<text>
		This article shall not prevent the plaintiff in any action at law from relying upon any other process provided by law.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 46-389; 1958, c. 541, § 46.1-391; 1989, c. 727.</history>
